                                  "Did you hear the Kick-off chime with the notification?", "Tap Pass or Fail."], place: .scooterHome),
        "c6d": CheckGuide(proves: "The \"Going for a ride?\" notification does not stay around after the scooter is off.",
                          steps: ["Do the c6 steps until the notification is on the lock screen.",
