        "ui1": CheckGuide(proves: "Home, Rides and the other tabs scroll all the way to their last item above the tab bar, and the ends give only a short, firm bounce.",
                          steps: ["Open Home and drag up to the end: Load for the next ride must sit fully above the tab bar. Pull a little further: it gives about a thumb-width and springs straight back.",
