        "ui3": CheckGuide(proves: "On a real ride the map moves smoothly instead of move-stop-move, turns so the direction you ride is up, and shows mostly the road ahead with your dot just above the speed tile.",
                          steps: ["Ride a street with a few turns with the CorckieApp screen on.", "Watch the map: it glides, turns with you, the dot stays just above the speed tile; standing still keeps it steady.", "Settings → Accessibility → Motion → Reduce Motion on: the map stays north-up without animation.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .ride),
        "ui4": CheckGuide(proves: "The app icon is the new one: an orange split C on a dark disc over beige, with orange drops.",
