        "u65": CheckGuide(proves: "The Rides list sorts into bubbles (by date, destination, day of week, time of day, distance, duration or battery used) with the newest ride on top in each, finds rides by place name or date, and shows one line of figures per ride; the ride detail shows the temperature only when the scooter got hot.",
                          steps: ["Developer → Checks → Run all automatic.", "Result: each sort, the search, the row figures and the heat rule say ok. The deleted sentences are also guarded by a build-time test."], place: .noScooter),
        "u66": CheckGuide(proves: "Stats shows one Week / Month / Year control, a small change chip on Distance, four Overall tiles and one money number; routes show one typical time and battery instead of ranges; the factors page has small bars; the grey explanation sentences are gone from these screens.",
