                                  "iPhone Settings → Display → Dark: the pages turn neutral dark grey, the orange stays. Start a simulated ride: the live screen is dark.",
                                  "Settings → Sunlight mode On: heavier text and high contrast as before.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note (what looks off?)."], place: .noScooter),
        "ui9": CheckGuide(proves: "The new tab bar: one flat capsule, five icons, Home in the middle as a normal icon, the open tab on an orange pill, hiding while you scroll down a list.",
