                                   "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .noScooter),
        "u67": CheckGuide(proves: "Add a place saves from the top bar: Save is off until a pin is dropped and the name is not empty, and the screens with a bottom action keep the tab bar out of the way.",
