        "ui16": CheckGuide(proves: "The start sound begins on the press and ends exactly when the live view is full.",
                          steps: ["Connect the scooter. Silent switch off, volume up.", "Press Start and listen: a soft thump at the instant of the press, an air rush rising while the button grows, two notes, then silence the moment the live view is full. Feel one firm tap at the press.", "Settings → Sounds → Ride start and end off: Start is silent (the tap stays). Back on.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .scooterHome),
        "ui17": CheckGuide(proves: "The battery voice warnings come at 20, 15 and 10 percent, once each, even with the silent switch on.",
                          steps: ["Put the silent switch on, start some music, ride (or run the simulator) until the battery reaches 20 percent.", "Ping-ping, the music gets quieter, a voice says: Battery at twenty percent, about N kilometres left. Then the music comes back. Two taps in your hand.", "Same at fifteen and ten. Nothing repeats.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .ride),
        "ui18": CheckGuide(proves: "A hot motor is spoken once.",
                          steps: ["When the motor reaches 90 degrees on a ride you hear ping-ping and Motor hot. It does not repeat while it stays hot; after it cooled below 90 and got hot again it speaks again.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note (or Skip if it never got hot)."], place: .passive),
        "ui19": CheckGuide(proves: "Will I make it? tells you before the ride if the battery is short and speaks in the ride only when there is real doubt.",
                          steps: ["Home with a destination chosen and a battery that is too low for it: the Where to? row is orange and reads Work needs about 40%, you have 45%. Nothing is spoken.", "Ride it hard: if the projection falls under the reserve for a minute you hear three quick pings and Work: arrive with three percent. or Work: two kilometres short. Once.", "Arriving gives a soft three-note chime.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .passive),
        "ui20": CheckGuide(proves: "The haptics are subtle and come only where agreed.",
                          steps: ["Connect: a soft tick. Start: a firm tap. Hold to end: light ticks while it fills and a strong tap at the end.", "Switch tabs, change Sort by and Week / Month / Year: a small tick each. Open a ride: a soft tap when the path finished drawing. List rows: nothing.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .passive),
        "ui21": CheckGuide(proves: "The animations are smooth, short and never decorative; with Reduce Motion everything becomes a plain fade.",
                          steps: ["Watch: numbers rolling on Home, Stats and ride tiles; the Connect icon breathing; Start growing into the live view; the ride summary path drawing and its tiles appearing one by one; the tab pill sliding; rows moving when you change Sort by; chart bars growing; grey placeholders fading into content.", "Settings app → Accessibility → Motion → Reduce Motion on: the same things are plain fades.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .passive),
        "ui22": CheckGuide(proves: "The big Home disc has depth and stays a perfect circle when pressed.",
                           steps: ["Home: the disc has a faint halo ring, a shadow under it, a lighter top edge and a darker bottom edge.", "Press and hold it: it shrinks slightly, the halo and shadow tighten, light and shade swap. It never turns oval.", "Connect, then press Start: only the icon and word change; the disc keeps its depth and grows into the live view from the pressed look.", "With Reduce Motion on it looks pressed but does not shrink. Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .scooterHome),
        "ui23": CheckGuide(proves: "The Stats bars grow one after another, not all at once.",
                           steps: ["Stats: switch the tab away and back, then tap Week, Month, Year. The bars rise from the baseline from left to right, each a hair after the one before.", "Reduce Motion on: the bars just appear. Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .passive),
        "ui24": CheckGuide(proves: "Loading shows grey placeholders in the final layout and fades into the content, never a spinner.",
                           steps: ["Open Stats, and a ride from Rides. For a moment grey shapes sit where the numbers and tiles will be, then they fade into the real content.", "Reduce Motion on: the same, as a plain fade. Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .passive),
        "ui25": CheckGuide(proves: "Start opens the live ride through a growing circle, with the sound and tap on the same frame.",
                           steps: ["Home, scooter ready: press Start. The disc presses in, then the live ride appears through a circle growing from the disc centre. The live screen does not slide up and the disc never turns oval.", "The Kick-off sound and the firm tap begin exactly when the circle starts to grow.", "Reduce Motion on: a plain fade and the short start sound. Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .scooterHome),
        "ui26": CheckGuide(proves: "The Load row offers Unloaded, 5, 10 and a typed number, and its pill slides like the tab bar.",
