        "ui30": CheckGuide(proves: "Ride Replay plays inside the app, in the app's own look, with a map, a moving dot, tiles and a chart that follow the clock.",
                           steps: ["Open a ride that has GPS. Dots menu (top right) → Replay: it opens full screen.", "The map shows the whole ride, the path coloured by speed. Tap Battery, Power, Elevation on the right: the path recolours and the chart strip changes.", "Press Play: the dot moves along the path, the cursor on the chart and the six tiles follow it. Try 1x, 5x, 20x. Drag the slider, then drag a finger along the chart: both move the dot.", "Tap the download button: a file is made and the share sheet opens (keep it on the phone, it contains real places). Close with X.", "Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .noScooter),
        "ui31": CheckGuide(proves: "The ride's speed and battery charts open full screen, zoom on time and read exact values.",
                           steps: ["Open a ride, scroll to Speed and battery, tap the charts (or the small arrows button).", "Turn the phone sideways: the charts go landscape. Pinch: both charts zoom on the same time; the slider moves the shown time; Reset shows the whole ride.", "Touch and slide a finger on either chart: one cursor on both, the time, km/h and battery % at the top.", "Close: back on the ride, upright. Other screens never turn sideways. Tap Pass or Fail with a note."], place: .noScooter),
        "ui32": CheckGuide(proves: "The ride detail map fits the ride, the battery chart is readable and the climbs show believable battery use.",
